{"t":"Darklight Spark","s":"darklight-spark-86621","k":"item","i":"assets/wiki/Darklight_Spark_6156ca.gif","q":1,"html":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" dir=\"ltr\" lang=\"en\"><div class=\"messagebox\" style=\"text-align:left;\"><figure class=\"mw-halign-left\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Go Forward Icon\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"25\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Go_Forward_Icon_f12cec.png\" width=\"25\"/></span><figcaption></figcaption></figure><p style=\"font-weight: bold;\">See also:</p><br/><p><a href=\"#/wiki/Darklight%20Field\">Darklight Field</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Agony%20Damage\">Agony Damage</a>, Agony, and <a href=\"#/wiki/Darkfield\">Darkfield</a></p></div><div class=\"twbox\">\n<aside class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-twbox pi-layout-default\" role=\"region\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"name\">Darklight Spark</h2>\n<figure class=\"pi-item pi-image\">\n<img alt=\"Darklight Spark\" class=\"pi-image-thumbnail\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Darklight_Spark_6156ca.gif\" width=\"32\"/>\n</figure>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">General Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"objectclass\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Classification</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Magical Effects<br/>Fields</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Field Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"lightcolor\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Light</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"colorbox\" style=\"background-color: #ff0033; width: 1em; height: 1em; display: inline-block;\"></span><span style=\"margin: 0 0 0 0.4em;\">2 sqm</span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"immobile\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Movable</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"no-cross\" title=\"No\">✗</span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"walkable\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Blocking</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"no-cross\" title=\"No\">✗</span></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Other Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"implemented\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Version</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">13.20.13560<br/><span class=\"implementation-date\">July 10, 2023<br/>Summer Update 2023</span></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\">See also: Objects<span class=\"explained\">Help</span></nav>\n</aside>\n<div id=\"w-twbox-intro\">\n<div id=\"w-object-profile\">\n<div id=\"w-twbox-image\"><img alt=\"latest?cb=20231227152241&amp;path-prefix=en&amp;format=original\" class=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Darklight_Spark_6156ca.gif\"/></div>\n<div id=\"w-twbox-look\"><div class=\"item-look tibiatext tibiagreen\">You see  darklight spark.<div class=\"p-weight\"></div><br/></div></div>\n<div class=\"\" id=\"w-twbox-sounds\"></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-object-location\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Location\">Location</span></h3>\n<p>Boss room of <a href=\"#/wiki/Vemiath\">Vemiath</a>, in the <a href=\"#/quest/rotten-blood-quest\">Rotten Blood Quest</a>.\n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-object-notes\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Notes\">Notes</span></h3>\n<p>Is the first stage of players tracks in the fight against <a href=\"#/wiki/Vemiath\">Vemiath</a>, lasting for four seconds and turning into a <a href=\"#/wiki/Darklight%20Field\">Darklight Field</a> afterwards. It deals 3% of maximum health per second while standing on it. \n</p><p>During <a href=\"#/wiki/Vemiath\">Vemiath</a>'s fight, players with full stack of room mechanics will get hit for a total of 18% of maximum health per second.\n</p>\n</div>\n<p><br/>\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div class=\"navigation\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Related_Pages\">Related Pages</span></h3>\n<div class=\"navigation-body navigation-list-wrapper\">\n<ul><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Darkfield\">Darkfield</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Darklight%20Field\">Darklight Field</a></li><li>Darklight Spark Effect</li><li><a href=\"#/quest/rotten-blood-quest\">Rotten Blood Quest</a></li><li>Status Effects</li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Vemiath\">Vemiath</a></li></ul>\n</div>\n</div></div></div>","quests":["rotten-blood-quest"],"howto":{"quests":[{"slug":"rotten-blood-quest","quest":"Rotten Blood Quest","step":"4-4","n":32,"title":"Controlar o teu contador de cargas","kind":"mention","coords":[]}]}}